{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2023-04-03 07:00:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION AND THE HALO TRUST JOIN FORCES TO IMPROVE FARM SAFETY THROUGH DEMINING PROGRAMS IN UKRAINE', 'text': "PHILADELPHIA AND THORNILL, SCOTLAND , APRIL 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC), A LEADING GLOBAL AGRICULTURAL SCIENCES COMPANY, AND THE HALO TRUST, A HUMANITARIAN NON-GOVERNMENTAL ORGANIZATION THAT PROTECTS LIVES AND RESTORES LIVELIHOODS OF PEOPLE AFFECTED BY CONFLICT, TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW COLLABORATION TO IMPROVE FARM SAFETY IN UKRAINE. UNDER THE UMBRELLA OF ITS CULTIVATING FREEDOM CAMPAIGN, FMC WILL DONATE 3% OF ITS 2023 SALES REVENUE IN UKRAINE TO SIGNIFICANTLY EXPAND THE HALO TRUST'S DEMINING EFFORTS IN IMPACTED REGIONS THROUGHOUT THE COUNTRY."}